==Hero Ability==

Multiplies pet ability power by:
<br><math>\left(PetT \times \frac{G}{3600} + 1\right)^{0.5} \times PetL^{0.8} \times C^{0.5} \times \frac{L}{4\,000\,000\,000} + 1</math>


Multiplies Incantation efficiency by:
<br><math>\left(\left(I+1\right) \times L \times \frac{G^{0.5}}{100}\right)^{0.65} \times \frac{1}{250\,000} + 1</math>

===Stances===
''See: [[Stance]]''

{{StanceTooltip|Meditation}} Stance charges shardless spells each second by:
<br><math>\log_{10}\left(1 + \left(I+1\right) \times G \times C \times L^2\right) \times 1\% + 6\%</math>

{{StanceTooltip|Defense}} Stance makes {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Furious Strike}} instant, and divides Incantation duration by:
<br><math>\log_{10}\left(1 + \left(I+1\right) \times G \times C \times L^2\right) + 1</math>

{{StanceTooltip|Berserk}} Stance multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>\left(I+1\right) \times C^{0.5} \times L \times \frac{G}{10\,000} + 1</math>


where:
* <math>PetT = \text{Pet Time, in Seconds}</math>
* <math>G = \text{Character Ability Power Growth Rate}</math>
* <math>PetL = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>C = \text{Character Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>I = \text{Incantation Spells Cast this Exile}+1</math>

